Here's a modified Scala code that allows for multiple rounds of the quiz with a running score total:
```
import scala.util.Random
val senses = Map(
  "sight" -> List("What is the name of the sense that allows us to see?", "eyes"),
  "hearing" -> List("What is the name of the sense that allows us to hear?", "ears"),
